        "description": "Rest is an important part of your training. Friday is always a day of rest in the Intermediate program. Be realistic about your fatigue level and don't feel guilty if you decide to take an additional day off. Specifically consider scheduling at least one extra rest day during those weeks when you choose to race.",
        "intensity": "none",
